    "title": "Atoll Bonger",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>BONGER is an easy-to-use popper.</span><br /><span>When jerked, the water flow from the unique shape of the upper part of the mouth, which has been cut in an inverted V, causes the body to sway, and the slender yet large-diameter mouth draws out the target while wrapping it in fine bubbles.</span><br /><span>Both long jerks and short popping are effective.</span><br /><span>The slim body has less air resistance and allows for a stable flying posture to achieve distance.</span></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length </span>190 - Gr. 87</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length </span>230 - Gr. 128</p></li></ul>",
